# mage — authored from all eight walk facings in pix/mage.png (design §16).
# A squat robe under the sprite's dominant brim and crooked cone.  The short
# staff stays in the hand instead of becoming a second tower beside the mage.
# Layers run bottom-up; first row is back, last row is front.

